    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Mastery Property.</strong> Your training lets you use the mastery property of one kind of Simple or Martial weapon of your choice, as long as you have proficiency with it. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can change the kind of weapon to another eligible kind.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-tlsAfP1ROTUYZjva\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>To change the weapon after a Long Rest, change the weapon mastery on your sheet.</p></section>",
